---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Glitched Network privacy policy.">
    <main class="legal-page">
        <article>
            <h1 class="font-PressStart2P">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>This policy explains the basic information Glitched Network may collect when you use the website, Minecraft server, or community spaces.</p>

            <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Minecraft usernames, UUIDs, chat messages, join history, punishments, claims, economy data, and gameplay logs needed to run the server.</li>
                <li>Discord usernames, messages, tickets, reports, and moderation history when you interact with the community Discord.</li>
                <li>Website analytics or technical logs such as browser type, page visits, IP address, and error information if those services are enabled by hosting or third-party tools.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>How We Use It</h2>
            <p>Information is used to operate the server, enforce rules, investigate reports, prevent abuse, improve features, and communicate with players.</p>

            <h2>Third Parties</h2>
            <p>The site and server may rely on services such as GitHub Pages, Discord, Minecraft-related APIs, and hosting or analytics providers. Those services may process data under their own policies.</p>

            <h2>Data Requests</h2>
            <p>To request correction or removal of information connected to you, contact staff through the official Discord. Some moderation, safety, backup, and transaction records may need to be retained.</p>
        </article>
    </main>
</MainLayout>
